"name": "Bilia AB",
"description": "Bilia AB engages in the distribution of cars and transport vehicles. It operates through the following segments: Service, Cars, and Fuels. The Service segment includes products and services within workshop and spare parts as well as store sales. The Cars segment consists of new and used cars and transport vehicles as well as supplementary services such as financing and insurance. The Fuels segment comprises sales of petrol, diesel, ethanol, compressed gas, and car washes. The company was founded on September 14, 1967 and is headquartered in Gothenburg, Sweden.",
